# Voltyks Admin Panel - Project Documentation

## Project Overview
Voltyks Admin Panel is a modern, RTL-enabled admin dashboard for managing the Voltyks EV charging platform.

### Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Angular 17+ (Standalone Components)
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Styling**: SCSS with component-level styles
- **UI/UX**: Dark/Light Mode Toggle, RTL Support, Cairo Font
- **UI Components**: Angular Material (Datepicker, Form Fields, Input)
- **Icons**: Material Icons
- **Localization**: Custom Date Adapters, Arabic (ar-EG)
- **Authentication**: Cookie-based JWT
- **API Communication**: HttpClient with RxJS Observables
- **State Management**: Services with BehaviorSubject for Theme & Sidebar

### Angular Material Modules Used
- **MatDatepickerModule** - Date selection with Arabic localization
- **MatInputModule** - Enhanced form inputs
- **MatFormFieldModule** - Form field wrapper with labels
- **MatNativeDateModule** - Native date adapter (extended for Arabic)
- **DateAdapter** - Custom Arabic date adapter
- **MAT_DATE_LOCALE** - Locale configuration

---

## Architecture

### Project Structure
```
voltyks-admin/
├── src/app/
│   ├── core/
│   │   ├── guards/          # Route guards (auth.guard.ts)
│   │   ├── interceptors/    # HTTP interceptors (auth.interceptor.ts)
│   │   ├── models/          # TypeScript interfaces & DTOs
│   │   └── services/
│   │       ├── auth/        # Authentication service
│   │       ├── admin/       # Admin API services
│   │       ├── theme.service.ts      # Dark/Light mode toggle
│   │       └── sidebar.service.ts    # Sidebar state management
│   ├── features/            # Feature modules (lazy loaded)
│   │   ├── dashboard/
│   │   ├── users/
│   │   │   ├── users-list/
│   │   │   └── user-details/
│   │   ├── fees/
│   │   ├── terms/
│   │   ├── protocol/
│   │   ├── reports/
│   │   ├── brands-models/
│   │   └── about/
│   ├── layout/              # Layout components
│   │   ├── header/          # Top navigation bar (responsive)
│   │   ├── sidebar/         # Side navigation (hover & mobile)
│   │   └── main-layout/     # Main container
│   └── shared/              # Shared components
│       └── components/
│           ├── pagination/
│           ├── loading-overlay/
│           ├── confirm-dialog/
│           └── toaster/
```

