## Configuration Files

### proxy.conf.json
```json
{
  "/api": {
    "target": "http://localhost:3000",
    "secure": false,
    "changeOrigin": true,
    "logLevel": "debug"
  }
}
```

### angular.json (Key Settings)
- Port: 4202
- RTL: true
- Cairo font loaded in index.html
- Material Icons enabled
- Assets: public/ and src/assets/

