## Authentication Flow

1. User enters credentials in login page
2. POST to /api/admin/auth/login
3. Server sets HTTP-only cookie with JWT
4. AuthInterceptor adds cookie to all subsequent requests
5. AuthGuard protects admin routes
6. Logout clears cookie via /api/admin/auth/logout

